{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1757927456\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARKING GARAGE SIMULATOR \u2013 KEYS, CUSTOMERS AND NIGHT SHIFTS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve inherited a run-down parking garage from your grandfather. A dusty cash register, a worn-out keychain, and a crowd of complaining customers\u2026 This place has a terrible reputation in the city, and it\u2019s now up to you to bring it back to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME CUSTOMERS, PARK CARS, COLLECT PAYMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City residents flood into your garage, each with a unique personality: impatient, elderly, VIP, or grumpy.<br>Take their cars, scan the tickets, and handle payments flawlessly. A single mistake can quickly escalate into big trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/8704711008bb88f36c00edcb094eff6f.poster.avif?t=1757927456\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/8704711008bb88f36c00edcb094eff6f.webm?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/8704711008bb88f36c00edcb094eff6f.mp4?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEYS AND VALETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When things get busy, it\u2019s time to rely on your valet team.<br>Each key must be properly labeled\u2014one mix-up and chaos begins.<br>Hire, train, and manage your staff carefully to keep everything running smoothly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHEN NIGHT FALLS, TROUBLE ARRIVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daytime is busy, but nighttime brings new dangers.<br>Thieves may sneak in to damage or steal cars.<br>Invest in cameras, lighting, and security guards to protect your business.<br>Remember: every damaged car hurts your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/2d5bc175ef7a83bcf2b53daa7d5b174e.poster.avif?t=1757927456\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/2d5bc175ef7a83bcf2b53daa7d5b174e.webm?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM A SMALL GARAGE TO A CITYWIDE CHAIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to expand parking space, improve lighting, and add stylish decorations.<br>The better your garage looks, the more customers you attract\u2014and the higher fees you can charge.<br>Unlock passive income sources and grow into a parking empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/e4b37771ac59c423b0582b8b8efd0d0a.poster.avif?t=1757927456\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/e4b37771ac59c423b0582b8b8efd0d0a.webm?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/e4b37771ac59c423b0582b8b8efd0d0a.mp4?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys get lost, customers lose patience, thieves lurk in the shadows\u2026<br>Running a parking garage is no easy job.<br>But manage it well, and you can turn a small lot into a citywide legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Add it to your wishlist now and start building your parking empire!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846650?t=1757927456","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/6eb0fc85bcc5f5c258de222a7c6e5a27c85b434d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757927456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/ee7e2f840c9ed427db4457e4495960f20a2e2ba1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757927456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/ee7e2f840c9ed427db4457e4495960f20a2e2ba1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757927456","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1757927456\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp