s.<br>Remember: every damaged car hurts your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/2d5bc175ef7a83bcf2b53daa7d5b174e.poster.avif?t=1757927456\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/2d5bc175ef7a83bcf2b53daa7d5b174e.webm?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM A SMALL GARAGE TO A CITYWIDE CHAIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to expand parking space, improve lighting, and add stylish decorations.<br>The better your garage looks, the more customers you attract\u2014and the higher fees you can charge.<br>Unlock passive income sources and grow into a parking empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/e4b37771ac59c423b0582b8b8efd0d0a.poster.avif?t=1757927456\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/e4b37771ac59c423b0582b8b8efd0d0a.webm?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/e4b37771ac59c423b0582b8b8efd0d0a.mp4?t=1757927456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys get lost, customers lose patience, thieves lurk in the shadows\u2026<br>Running a parking garage is no easy job.<br>But manage it well, and you can turn a small lot into a citywide legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Add it to your wishlist now and start building your parking empire!</p>","developers":["Root Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},