nd ensure security. Welcome to Parking Simulator with realistic mechanics and the chaos of city life!","steam_appid":3846650,"support_info":{"email":"contact@redaxegames.com","url":"https://redaxegames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, Turkish, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Ukrainian, Polish","type":"game","website":null}